  "document": "Rita Wilson\nRita Wilson (born Margarita Ibrahimoff; October 26, 1956) is an American actress, singer, voice actress, activist, and producer. She appeared in the films \"Sleepless in Seattle\" (1993), \"Now and Then\" (1995), \"Jingle All the Way\" (1996), \"The Story of Us\" (1999) and \"Runaway Bride\" (1999). Wilson has also performed on Broadway and on television, and she has produced several films, including \"My Big Fat Greek Wedding\" (2002)."
